# Workflow

- One issue per branch/PR. Branch: `issue-<n>-<slug>`. PR title: `[M#] #<issue>: <title>`. Body: `Closes #N` + how each acceptance-criteria checkbox is met + deviations.
- Respect `> Blocked by #N` lines in issue bodies; blockers must be merged first. Issue #22 must be merged before starting any other M6 issue.
- Every AC checkbox needs a test where testable. Never quietly drop scope — flag impossibilities in the PR description.
- CI (typecheck + vitest + lint) must be green. **Claude reviews every PR before merge; never self-merge.**
- Keep PRs scoped to their issue; incidental refactors go in separate PRs.
- New runtime dependencies require written justification in the PR (static-page bundle budget).
